From: Gli_acopo <82150202+GliAcopo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 15:03:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 09/10] skip drd_update when neither the drd nor the
 environment changed

update_menus runs after each pause in typing and called heuristic_init
on the full environment at the cursor (tens of milliseconds for large
styles).  Calling it again with the same drd and an equal environment is
a no-op, so remember the last call, together with a stamp which every
drd mutation increments.
---
 src/Data/Drd/drd_info.cpp        | 29 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/Edit/Editor/edit_typeset.cpp | 32 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 60 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

